// Client-only map asset visuals. `theme_kits` (BRL-0153) give every presentation theme its own
// original kit: a kit visual replaces the default with the same id on maps of that theme, all
// imported from the kit directory (`asset_src/environment/<kit>/`), with colour authored in the
// kit palette. `visuals` are the defaults for a visual a theme's kit does not cover (for example a
// Map Maker document placing another theme's prop); every imported default names the original kit
// piece of its native theme (BRL-0188), and validation rejects imports outside the kit directories.
